# Copy this file to .env.local and paste the real values in.
#
# .env.local is gitignored and never committed. Neither value is ever printed
# by this service, echoed in a response, or written to a log (§10: "The key is
# never typed into a chat. .env.local, Vercel env vars, and a password
# manager.").

# From console.anthropic.com, on the account separate from the Max
# subscription, with a monthly spend limit set. This is the only place the key
# lives besides Vercel and the password manager.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# The token callers must send as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.
# Generate one with:  npm run make-token
# If this is unset, the service accepts nothing and returns 401 (§2.1).
CAPTURE_TOKEN=

# Optional. Defaults to the smallest model; see src/model.ts.
# CAPTURE_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5
